	<item>
		<title>Home</title>
		<link>https://solar.test/</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[amina]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>Clean power for homes</h2>
<p>Example Solar installs rooftop panels and batteries for homes and small businesses in Nairobi. We have installed more than four hundred systems since 2019, each one designed for the roof it sits on.</p>
<p>Read <a href="https://solar.test/2026/10/01/hello-sun/">why we started</a>, see our <a href="https://solar.test/products/panel-400/">400 W panel</a>, or <a href="https://solar.test/contact/">ask for a quote</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://solar.test/private/">Staff notes</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Rooftop solar for homes in Nairobi.]]></excerpt:encoded>
