	<item>
		<title>About us</title>
		<link>https://solar.test/about/</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[amina]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We are a team of eight engineers and installers. Every installation is surveyed, designed and wired by our own staff, and we stay on call for the life of the system.</p>
<figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://solar.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/team.png" alt="The installation team on a roof"><figcaption>The team in October.</figcaption></figure>
<h2>How we work</h2>
<ul><li>A free site survey</li><li>A written design and quote</li><li>Installation in two days</li></ul>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Who we are and how we work.]]></excerpt:encoded>
