	<item>
		<title>Hello, sun</title>
		<link>https://solar.test/2026/10/01/hello-sun/</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[amina]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Our first panel went up in 2019 on a school roof in Kibera. It still produces more than it did on day one, because we clean it every quarter.</p>
<p>This blog is where we share what we learn from every installation.</p>]]></content:encoded>
