	<item>
		<title>Caring for your panels</title>
		<link>https://solar.test/2026/10/12/panel-care/</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[otieno]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Dust costs a panel up to a fifth of its output in the dry season. Rinse panels with clean water early in the morning, never with soap, and never climb onto the roof yourself.</p>
<p>We include two cleaning visits a year with every installation.</p>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Keep your panels producing.]]></excerpt:encoded>
